Revision history for JS::Minifier

{{$NEXT}}

    - Initial release: a fork of JS::Minify by Sam Morrison, rewritten for
      performance and reliability
    - New CLI tool bin/jsminify
    - Shebang, bang-comment, template literal, and NOCOMPRESS support
    - drop_console/drop_debugger options; true/false shortened in value
      contexts; semicolons removed before closing braces
    - Numerous bug fixes (out-of-bounds reads, line continuation,
      unterminated string detection, division/regex misclassification,
      CRLF normalization, U+2028/U+2029 line terminators)
